            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Fixed
- **The Live Activity card stops flickering between projects.** When several
  agents were working it renamed its headline and reshuffled its dots every few
  seconds, too fast to read. It now stays on one session while that session is
  working, and only updates when something actually changed.
]]></description>
